00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Amelia Bennett, Oliver Fischer, Sofia Rossi, Mateo Silva, Emil Novak, Nora Berg, Lucas Martin, Elena Popov, Oscar Khan, Clara Dubois.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Kaze ga shizuka ni yama o koete yuku. Hikari wa tooku no umi ni kieru. Watashi wa hoshi o mite kimi no koe o omou. Ashita mo kono michi o hitori de aruite yukou.
